One suggestion for the Dev team:  Before Nethack, I played Moria a lot and
won it a few times.  At the end of the game, Moria allows you to view a 
winning character sheet and print it to a file.  These character sheets are
used to post winning characters to rec.games.moria.  This allows everyone's
winning post to show the same data in the same format and also makes it 
easier to gather the information to post.  I would like to see an option to
store the important parts of the final listing of inventory/attributes to a
file so that we can just post that when we want to show our winning char-
acters.  It would take some deciding to determine just what to show so that
these winning posts didn't get too long (maybe just a printout of stats, 
armor, weapons, and gold), but IMHO it would make winning posts much nicer
looking and easier to create.  Opinions?
